    Pairing schemes (GVB(2,2) geminal pairs)

      scheme 0 : (a,d) & (b,c)
      scheme 1 : (a,c) & (b,d)

        GVB(2,2) wavefunctions for pair (p,q)
          Singlet closed-shell
            Psi_0(p,q) = +1/sqrt(2.0) * sqrt(n0_p) * |p,p_|
                         -1/sqrt(2.0) * sqrt(n0_q) * |q,q_|
            Psi_2(p,q) = +1/sqrt(2.0) * sqrt(n0_q) * |p,p_|
                         +1/sqrt(2.0) * sqrt(n0_p) * |q,q_|
          Singlet open-shell
            Psi_1(p,q) = +1/sqrt(2.0) * |p,q_|
                         +1/sqrt(2.0) * |q,p_|
          FON constraint: n_p + n_q = 2.0

